    "body":  "## Summary\n\nDocument the agreed optional top-level `when` field in the existing `contract.yaml` as a proposed author-format extension. Show the OpenAMSM MAS CEL example and distinguish selection-time applicability from execution-time Predicates.\n\nThe frozen v1alpha5 release and buildable YAML examples retain their published syntax. The excerpt demonstrates the proposal pending language and compiler adoption.\n\n## Verification\n\nVerified the branch diff against `main`. It contains the two authoring guides and the examples README. Repository verification was unavailable because Git transport could not clone the checkout.",
